OL,3,GNEWSAPC on final warning sexually
OL,4,Aharassed trainees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer sexually harassed two
OL,7,Ftrainee officers he was supposed to be
OL,8,Ftutoring months after being given a
OL,9,Ffinal warning for sending explicit
OL,10,Fpictures of himself in his uniform.
OL,12,FPC Simon Rickard's "predatory"
OL,13,Fbehaviour caused one of the trainees to
OL,14,Fphysically shake with anxiety and
OL,15,Fcontributed to her decision to quit the
OL,16,Fforce, a Greater Manchester Police
OL,17,Fmisconduct panel heard.
OL,19,FRickard also took a secret photograph
OL,20,Fof the other victim before showing it
OL,21,Fto her and making a lewd comment about
OL,22,Fperforming a sex act on himself.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
